# A misspelled `filter` is skipped up to the next pipe, with a hint about `where`; the next operator still gets its own error.
mode: syntax
---- query
from 'orders.csv' | filtr amount = 1 | sort amount desc
---- expected
PROGRAM@0..56
  PIPELINE@0..55
    IDENT@0..4 "from"
    WHITESPACE@4..5 " "
    LITERAL@5..17
      STRING@5..17 "'orders.csv'"
    WHITESPACE@17..18 " "
    PIPE@18..19 "|"
    WHITESPACE@19..20 " "
    ERROR@20..36
      IDENT@20..25 "filtr"
      WHITESPACE@25..26 " "
      IDENT@26..32 "amount"
      WHITESPACE@32..33 " "
      EQ@33..34 "="
      WHITESPACE@34..35 " "
      LONG@35..36 "1"
    WHITESPACE@36..37 " "
    PIPE@37..38 "|"
    WHITESPACE@38..39 " "
    SORT_OP@39..55
      IDENT@39..43 "sort"
      WHITESPACE@43..44 " "
      SORT_KEY@44..55
        NAME_REF@44..50
          IDENT@44..50 "amount"
        WHITESPACE@50..51 " "
        IDENT@51..55 "desc"
  WHITESPACE@55..56 "\n"

error[DS0104]: unknown operator `filtr`
  --> query:1:21
  |
1 | from 'orders.csv' | filtr amount = 1 | sort amount desc
  |                     ^^^^^ not an operator
  |
  = help: to keep the rows that match a condition, use `where`

error[DS0121]: missing `by` after `sort`
  --> query:1:45
  |
1 | from 'orders.csv' | filtr amount = 1 | sort amount desc
  |                                             ^^^^^^ expected `by` before this
  |
  = help: insert `by`: `sort by amount desc`

with the machine-applicable fixes applied:
    from 'orders.csv' | filtr amount = 1 | sort by amount desc
which still has errors:

error[DS0104]: unknown operator `filtr`
  --> fixed:1:21
  |
1 | from 'orders.csv' | filtr amount = 1 | sort by amount desc
